{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e04-scene-03",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "池沢と武井はつながってるんだよ  (Ikezawa and Detective Takei Are Connected)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "toshi": "トシ",
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "furuya": "古谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At an open-air drink stall in Tokyo, Toshi grumbles that their big talk in Hokkaido means nothing while rival Ikezawa dominates sales—until yakuza boss Furuya sits down beside them. Listen to Toshi, Muranishi, and Furuya in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "北海道では勝負するって大口たたいてたけど、現実は天と地だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はそうは思わない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ほえててもしょうがねえだろ、現実は池沢が売れてんだからよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これからだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "モヤモヤした時は安酒かっ食らうのが一番だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "どうだ、少しは歌舞伎町に慣れたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まあ、ぼちぼちです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "あんたは商才がある。頑張ってまたもうけさせてくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "池沢にまたやられるようなヘマだけはすんなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "またって何ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "お前らがパクられたのは、池沢の仕掛けなんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "池沢と武井はつながってるんだよ。次は守ってやるよ、俺は味方だからよ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "北海道では勝負するって大口たたいてたけど、現実は天と地だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Up in Hokkaido we talked big about competing, yet reality is heaven and earth apart.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "俺はそうは思わない。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't see it that way.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "ほえててもしょうがねえだろ、現実は池沢が売れてんだからよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Barking does no good when the reality is that Ikezawa's tapes are the ones selling.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "これからだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are only getting started.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "モヤモヤした時は安酒かっ食らうのが一番だな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When your head feels murky, gulping cheap booze is the best cure.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "どうだ、少しは歌舞伎町に慣れたか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How about it — gotten used to this district a little yet?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "まあ、ぼちぼちです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, little by little.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "あんたは商才がある。頑張ってまたもうけさせてくれよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You've got real business flair; work hard and make me rich again.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "池沢にまたやられるようなヘマだけはすんなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Just don't blunder into letting Ikezawa burn you a second time.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "またって何ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you mean by a second time?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "お前らがパクられたのは、池沢の仕掛けなんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Your getting busted up north was a setup engineered by Ikezawa.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "池沢と武井はつながってるんだよ。次は守ってやるよ、俺は味方だからよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ikezawa and Takei are in cahoots. Next time I'll protect you — I'm on your side.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
